<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">

<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
  <title>Our Team | shadiAmour Matchmaking Consultants</title>

  <!-- SEO Meta Tags -->
  <meta name="description" content="Meet the shadiAmour team — experienced matchmaking consultants helping busy Muslim professionals across the UK find a halal spouse the right way." />
  <meta name="keywords" content="shadiamour muslim team, muslim matrimony team uk, shadiamour founders, halal matchmaking team, muslim marriage platform team" />
  <link rel="canonical" href="https://shadiamour.com/our-team" />

  <!-- Open Graph -->
  <meta property="og:title" content="Our Team | shadiAmour Matchmaking Consultants" />
  <meta property="og:description" content="Meet the shadiAmour team — experienced matchmaking consultants helping busy Muslim professionals across the UK find a halal spouse the right way." />
  <meta property="og:url" content="https://shadiamour.com/our-team" />
  <meta property="og:type" content="website" />

  <!-- Structured Data: Organization -->
  <script type="application/ld+json">
  {
    "@context": "https://schema.org",
    "@type": "Organization",
    "name": "shadiamour",
    "url": "https://shadiamour.com",
    "description": "The UK's trusted halal Muslim matrimonial platform"
  }
  </script>

  <!-- Favicon -->
  <link rel="apple-touch-icon" sizes="180x180" href="/images/apple-touch-icon.png">
  <link rel="icon" type="image/png" sizes="32x32" href="/images/favicon-32x32.png">
  <link rel="icon" type="image/png" sizes="16x16" href="/images/favicon-16x16.png">
  <link rel="icon" type="image/x-icon" href="/images/favicon.ico">
  <link rel="manifest" href="/images/site.webmanifest">
  <meta name="theme-color" content="#00113a">

  <!-- Stylesheets -->
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/output.css" />
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/remixicon/4.6.0/remixicon.min.css" />
</head>

<body class="bg-background text-on-background font-body-md antialiased flex flex-col min-h-screen">
  <%- include('./partials/header') %>

  <main class="flex-grow pt-[92px]">
    <!-- Hero Section -->
    <section class="py-section-padding px-margin-x max-w-container-max mx-auto text-center flex flex-col items-center">
      <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-4 py-1.5 bg-secondary-container/20 border border-secondary-container/40 rounded-full text-secondary font-label-md text-sm font-medium mb-6">
        <i class="ri-team-line"></i>
        <span>The People Behind the Platform</span>
      </div>
      <h1 class="text-display-lg-mobile md:text-display-lg font-display-lg-mobile md:font-display-lg text-primary mb-6 leading-tight">
        Meet Our Team
      </h1>
      <p class="text-body-lg font-body-lg text-on-surface-variant max-w-3xl mx-auto">
        shadiamour is built and operated by a passionate team of Muslims committed to helping the British Muslim community find their spouse through a trusted, halal-first platform.
      </p>
    </section>

    <!-- Who We Are -->
    <section class="py-section-padding px-margin-x bg-neutral-gray border-y border-outline-variant/20">
      <div class="max-w-container-max mx-auto">
        <div class="grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-8 items-center">
          <div>
            <h2 class="text-headline-lg font-headline-lg text-primary mb-4">Who We Are</h2>
            <p class="text-body-md font-body-md text-on-surface-variant leading-relaxed mb-4">
              shadiAmour was built by a small team of matchmaking professionals who understand what young Muslim professionals in the UK are looking for. We combine modern tools with traditional rishta values to help you find your spouse without the pressure of casual dating apps or the limitations of word-of-mouth rishta.
            </p>
            <p class="text-body-md font-body-md text-on-surface-variant leading-relaxed">
              Our team combines matchmaking experience with a genuine understanding of what young Muslim professionals in the UK are looking for — balancing career ambitions, family expectations, and the desire for a sincere, halal marriage.
            </p>
          </div>
          <div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 gap-4">
            <div class="bg-surface-white p-6 rounded-xl shadow-[0px_4px_20px_rgba(0,35,102,0.05)] border border-outline-variant/30 flex flex-col items-center text-center">
              <div class="w-16 h-16 bg-primary-fixed rounded-full flex items-center justify-center text-primary-container mb-4">
                <span class="material-symbols-outlined">verified_user</span>
              </div>
              <p class="font-semibold text-on-surface text-sm">Manual Verification</p>
              <p class="text-on-surface-variant text-xs mt-1">Every profile reviewed by our team</p>
            </div>
            <div class="bg-surface-white p-6 rounded-xl shadow-[0px_4px_20px_rgba(0,35,102,0.05)] border border-outline-variant/30 flex flex-col items-center text-center">
              <div class="w-16 h-16 bg-primary-fixed rounded-full flex items-center justify-center text-primary-container mb-4">
                <span class="material-symbols-outlined">mosque</span>
              </div>
              <p class="font-semibold text-on-surface text-sm">Halal-First Design</p>
              <p class="text-on-surface-variant text-xs mt-1">Islamic values in every feature</p>
            </div>
            <div class="bg-surface-white p-6 rounded-xl shadow-[0px_4px_20px_rgba(0,35,102,0.05)] border border-outline-variant/30 flex flex-col items-center text-center">
              <div class="w-16 h-16 bg-primary-fixed rounded-full flex items-center justify-center text-primary-container mb-4">
                <span class="material-symbols-outlined">diversity_3</span>
              </div>
              <p class="font-semibold text-on-surface text-sm">Community Support</p>
              <p class="text-on-surface-variant text-xs mt-1">Dedicated member assistance</p>
            </div>
            <div class="bg-surface-white p-6 rounded-xl shadow-[0px_4px_20px_rgba(0,35,102,0.05)] border border-outline-variant/30 flex flex-col items-center text-center">
              <div class="w-16 h-16 bg-primary-fixed rounded-full flex items-center justify-center text-primary-container mb-4">
                <span class="material-symbols-outlined">lock</span>
              </div>
              <p class="font-semibold text-on-surface text-sm">Privacy First</p>
              <p class="text-on-surface-variant text-xs mt-1">UK GDPR compliant platform</p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- The Team -->
    <section class="py-section-padding px-margin-x max-w-container-max mx-auto">
      <% if (members && members.length > 0) { %>
      <div class="text-center mb-16">
        <h2 class="text-headline-lg font-headline-lg text-primary mb-4">The Team</h2>
        <p class="text-body-lg font-body-lg text-on-surface-variant">The people working every day to make shadiamour the UK's most trusted Muslim matrimonial platform.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3 gap-gutter">
        <% members.forEach(member => { %>
        <article class="bg-surface-white rounded-[16px] shadow-[0px_4px_20px_rgba(0,35,102,0.05)] border border-outline-variant/20 overflow-hidden group flex flex-col">
          <div class="h-64 relative bg-surface-container-high overflow-hidden">
            <% if (member.photo && member.photo.url) { %>
            <img
              src="<%= member.photo.url %>"
              alt="<%= member.name %> — <%= member.designation %> at shadiamour"
              class="w-full h-full object-cover group-hover:scale-105 transition-transform duration-500"
              loading="lazy" />
            <% } else { %>
            <div class="absolute inset-0 flex items-center justify-center">
              <div class="w-24 h-24 rounded-full bg-primary/10 flex items-center justify-center">
                <i class="ri-user-line text-4xl text-primary opacity-60"></i>
              </div>
            </div>
            <% } %>
          </div>
          <div class="p-6 flex flex-col flex-grow">
            <h3 class="text-headline-md font-headline-md text-primary"><%= member.name %></h3>
            <p class="text-label-md font-label-md text-premium-gold mb-4"><%= member.designation %></p>
            <% if (member.bio) { %>
            <p class="text-body-md font-body-md text-on-surface-variant">
              <%= member.bio %>
            </p>
            <% } else { %>
            <p class="text-body-md font-body-md text-on-surface-variant">
              Dedicated member of the shadiamour team helping Muslims find marriage through a halal-first platform.
            </p>
            <% } %>
          </div>
        </article>
        <% }) %>
      </div>
      <% } else { %>
      <!-- Empty State -->
      <div class="bg-surface-white rounded-2xl shadow-[0px_4px_20px_rgba(0,35,102,0.05)] border border-outline-variant/20 p-16 text-center">
        <i class="ri-team-line text-6xl text-outline-variant mb-4 block"></i>
        <h3 class="text-headline-md font-headline-md text-on-surface mb-2">
          Team Profiles Coming Soon
        </h3>
        <p class="text-body-md font-body-md text-on-surface-variant max-w-md mx-auto">
          We're updating our team page. In the meantime, you can reach us at
          <a href="mailto:contact@shadiamour.com" class="text-primary hover:underline">
            contact@shadiamour.com
          </a>
        </p>
      </div>
      <% } %>
    </section>

    <!-- What Our Team Does -->
    <section class="py-section-padding px-margin-x bg-surface-container-low">
      <div class="max-w-container-max mx-auto">
        <div class="text-center mb-16">
          <h2 class="text-headline-lg font-headline-lg text-primary mb-4">What Our Team Does</h2>
          <p class="text-body-lg font-body-lg text-on-surface-variant">Every day, our team works behind the scenes to keep shadiAmour safe, sincere, and supportive.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4 gap-6">
          <div class="p-6 bg-surface-white rounded-xl border border-outline-variant/30 flex flex-col items-start">
            <div class="w-12 h-12 bg-primary-fixed text-primary-container rounded-xl flex items-center justify-center mb-4">
              <span class="material-symbols-outlined">verified_user</span>
            </div>
            <h4 class="text-label-md font-label-md text-primary mb-2">Profile Verification</h4>
            <p class="text-body-md font-body-md text-on-surface-variant text-sm">Every profile is manually checked before it goes live, so you can be confident you're speaking with a genuine person.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="p-6 bg-surface-white rounded-xl border border-outline-variant/30 flex flex-col items-start">
            <div class="w-12 h-12 bg-primary-fixed text-primary-container rounded-xl flex items-center justify-center mb-4">
              <span class="material-symbols-outlined">forum</span>
            </div>
            <h4 class="text-label-md font-label-md text-primary mb-2">Matchmaking Consultations</h4>
            <p class="text-body-md font-body-md text-on-surface-variant text-sm">We offer one-to-one guidance for members who want extra support navigating their marriage search the halal way.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="p-6 bg-surface-white rounded-xl border border-outline-variant/30 flex flex-col items-start">
            <div class="w-12 h-12 bg-primary-fixed text-primary-container rounded-xl flex items-center justify-center mb-4">
              <span class="material-symbols-outlined">gpp_good</span>
            </div>
            <h4 class="text-label-md font-label-md text-primary mb-2">Community Moderation</h4>
            <p class="text-body-md font-body-md text-on-surface-variant text-sm">Our moderators keep the platform respectful and safe, acting quickly on any reports of inappropriate behaviour.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="p-6 bg-surface-white rounded-xl border border-outline-variant/30 flex flex-col items-start">
            <div class="w-12 h-12 bg-primary-fixed text-primary-container rounded-xl flex items-center justify-center mb-4">
              <span class="material-symbols-outlined">support_agent</span>
            </div>
            <h4 class="text-label-md font-label-md text-primary mb-2">Member Support</h4>
            <p class="text-body-md font-body-md text-on-surface-variant text-sm">Our support team is here for you at every step — from profile setup to questions about your matches.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- Our Values -->
    <section class="py-section-padding px-margin-x bg-surface-container-low">
      <div class="max-w-container-max mx-auto">
        <div class="text-center mb-16">
          <h2 class="text-headline-lg font-headline-lg text-primary mb-4">Our Values</h2>
          <p class="text-body-lg font-body-lg text-on-surface-variant">Three principles guide everything we do.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-6">
          <div class="flex flex-col items-center text-center p-8 bg-surface-white rounded-xl border border-outline-variant/30">
            <div class="w-16 h-16 bg-primary-fixed rounded-full flex items-center justify-center text-primary-container mb-5">
              <span class="material-symbols-outlined">menu_book</span>
            </div>
            <h4 class="text-label-md font-label-md text-primary mb-2">Sincerity (Ikhlas)</h4>
            <p class="text-body-md font-body-md text-on-surface-variant text-sm">We are honest about what we offer, how we work, and who we serve — in our advertising, our platform, and our people.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="flex flex-col items-center text-center p-8 bg-surface-white rounded-xl border border-outline-variant/30">
            <div class="w-16 h-16 bg-primary-fixed rounded-full flex items-center justify-center text-primary-container mb-5">
              <span class="material-symbols-outlined">visibility_off</span>
            </div>
            <h4 class="text-label-md font-label-md text-primary mb-2">Privacy</h4>
            <p class="text-body-md font-body-md text-on-surface-variant text-sm">Your personal information stays private. We are UK GDPR compliant and never sell or expose your data.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="flex flex-col items-center text-center p-8 bg-surface-white rounded-xl border border-outline-variant/30">
            <div class="w-16 h-16 bg-primary-fixed rounded-full flex items-center justify-center text-primary-container mb-5">
              <span class="material-symbols-outlined">favorite</span>
            </div>
            <h4 class="text-label-md font-label-md text-primary mb-2">Respect</h4>
            <p class="text-body-md font-body-md text-on-surface-variant text-sm">We treat every member, family, and match with dignity — moderating our community to keep it safe and welcoming.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- Get in Touch -->
    <section class="py-section-padding px-margin-x max-w-container-max mx-auto">
      <div class="text-center mb-10">
        <h2 class="text-headline-lg font-headline-lg text-primary mb-4">Get in Touch with Our Team</h2>
        <p class="text-body-md font-body-md text-on-surface-variant max-w-2xl mx-auto">
          Whether you have a question about your profile, want to report an issue, or have a partnership enquiry — our team is available to help. We aim to respond to all enquiries within 24 hours.
        </p>
      </div>
      <div class="grid sm:grid-cols-3 gap-4 max-w-4xl mx-auto">
        <a href="mailto:contact@shadiamour.com" class="flex items-center gap-3 p-5 bg-surface-white rounded-xl border border-outline-variant/30 hover:border-primary transition-all duration-200 group">
          <div class="w-11 h-11 bg-primary rounded-full flex items-center justify-center flex-shrink-0">
            <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-on-primary">mail</span>
          </div>
          <div class="min-w-0">
            <p class="text-label-md font-label-md text-on-surface-variant mb-0.5">General Enquiries</p>
            <p class="text-body-md font-body-md text-on-surface truncate">contact@shadiamour.com</p>
          </div>
        </a>
        <a href="mailto:support@shadiamour.com" class="flex items-center gap-3 p-5 bg-surface-white rounded-xl border border-outline-variant/30 hover:border-primary transition-all duration-200 group">
          <div class="w-11 h-11 bg-primary rounded-full flex items-center justify-center flex-shrink-0">
            <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-on-primary">support_agent</span>
          </div>
          <div class="min-w-0">
            <p class="text-label-md font-label-md text-on-surface-variant mb-0.5">Member Support</p>
            <p class="text-body-md font-body-md text-on-surface truncate">support@shadiamour.com</p>
          </div>
        </a>
        <a href="mailto:issues@shadiamour.com" class="flex items-center gap-3 p-5 bg-surface-white rounded-xl border border-outline-variant/30 hover:border-primary transition-all duration-200 group">
          <div class="w-11 h-11 bg-primary rounded-full flex items-center justify-center flex-shrink-0">
            <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-on-primary">bug_report</span>
          </div>
          <div class="min-w-0">
            <p class="text-label-md font-label-md text-on-surface-variant mb-0.5">Bug Reports</p>
            <p class="text-body-md font-body-md text-on-surface truncate">issues@shadiamour.com</p>
          </div>
        </a>
      </div>
    </section>
  </main>

  <%- include('./partials/footer') %>
  <%- include('./partials/analytics') %>
</body>

</html>
